Z||000007||theogre||12-18-1999||02:11 PM||||"Sometimes the needs of the one outweigh the needs of the many, but you can't fit that into your logic."  Paraphrased Spock's Mother, ST3<P>If the motor ran well the whole car it worth about the salvage yard price of the motor. Usually that 1-2$ per cubic inch for a stock motor.||||reg||1
